,"dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江蓠馆十绝句为朱鸿胪在明题 其六 快阁","author":"王世贞","text":"披襟称快哉，天地雄风来。\n何以金茎表，吸取露一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11831,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江蓠馆十绝句为朱鸿胪在明题 其七 凝香室","author":"王世贞","text":"湘帘静不捲，芳篆萦如丝。\n借问仙省吏，得似含香时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11832,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江蓠馆十绝句为朱鸿胪在明题 其八 啸台","author":"王世贞","text":"欲与天籁争，披云独箕踞。\n忽作鸾凤音，犹然遍千树。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11833,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江蓠馆十绝句为朱鸿胪在明题 其九 鹤院","author":"王世贞","text":"虽甘稻粱美，终爱云霄去。\n蕙帐犹未空，翮成且须住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11834,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江蓠馆十绝句为朱鸿胪在明题 其十 雨花庵","author":"王世贞","text":"兀坐净名身，时谈香积因。\n如花两仙女，知是散花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11835,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄生填抚南牧马所赋二绝句送之 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"君过腾越峰，骏骨随龙化。\n倘遇千里驹，莫惜千金价。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11836,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄生填抚南牧马所赋二绝句送之 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"调弓射堂下，戏马台城侧。\n莫作王骑曹，拄笏西山色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11837,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小景","author":"王世贞","text":"北垞带南垞，前帆衔后帆。\n欲知何处泊，斜日在松杉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11838,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"憩徐少卿墓","author":"王世贞","text":"宿草封云壮，高杉背日寒。\n客来无剑挂，事往有琴弹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11839,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题绣毬花","author":"王世贞","text":"暂以碧云色，微笼春月圆。\n抛人暗香里，误马软尘边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11840,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画兰花","author":"王世贞","text":"处为幽谷香，出为王者瑞。\n不同百草归，秋风纫成佩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11841,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初出京口","author":"王世贞","text":"楚歌一声发，吴侬双泪涟。\n武昌应尚远，船是武昌船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11842,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜泊芦夹回望燕子矶","author":"王世贞","text":"风吹浩荡去，却在芦江湄。\n燕子矶头月，清光当待谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11843,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊金陵","author":"王世贞","text":"不登凤凰台，为怯李家句。\n听说长干儿，朋尊向台去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11844,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初发石头","author":"王世贞","text":"亭亭远山色，入我船窗来。\n斗语虽不竞，那无酒一杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11845,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烈洲在江中树颇多","author":"王世贞","text":"郁郁烈洲树，宛然江水间。\n行人自不上，妒杀道金山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11846,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牛渚即采石也","author":"王世贞","text":"玄晖既遒往，李白时一振。\n请看沧江流，万古才不尽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11847,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宣城道中阻水不得上","author":"王世贞","text":"夜不闻白猿，朝不见白鹇。\n忘却下江水，错恨恋舟山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11848,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东西梁山一名天门山在江中","author":"王世贞","text":"东梁与西梁，髵䰄双虎头。\n可怜长江水，分作川字流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11849,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中过铜陵遇雨","author":"王世贞","text":"江馆能收望，渔矶亦罢罾。\n谁怜伏枕客，风雨过铜陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11850,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"历阳道中阻风","author":"王世贞","text":"进步咫尺间，一落不复上。\n安得勒将军，为我牵百丈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11851,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行热无鱼买戏成","author":"王世贞","text":"十日不尝鱼，九日不却暑。\n愿作西南风，吹侬转乡土。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11852,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"余尝梦登九华阳山矶可以见九华而病热昏寐竟过志感","author":"王世贞","text":"九华九子秀，十年梦寐间。\n那知一梦觉，顿失九华山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11853,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过马当","author":"王世贞","text":"人云下元府，莫作马当看。\n自有天公仗，那能问水官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11854,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"安庆道中","author":"王世贞","text":"平波细若剪，远岫膏于沐。\n嗒坐舫斋中，空翠时一扑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11855,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过皖城","author":"王世贞","text":"不问江南北，江风任往还。\n杯中是何物，青峭皖公山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11856,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和尚矶在采石道士洑在蕲水小孤中立焉","author":"王世贞","text":"东是和尚矶，西是道士洑。\n那能教小姑，不就彭郎宿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11857,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"祭小孤神祠作","author":"王世贞","text":"小孤有神祠，亭亭大江中。\n行人俱赛祭，那得往来风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11858,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彭泽颜明府来谒","author":"王世贞","text":"偶然折腰罢，满路青山看。\n却笑陶彭泽，何因便去官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11859,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过浔阳","author":"王世贞","text":"功名侮余甚，厌之不能舍。\n试问庐山峰，可晓白司马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11860,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望大孤山","author":"王世贞","text":"人言大孤丑，不及小孤妍。\n若向鄱阳去，南风也系船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11861,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"神鸦","author":"王世贞","text":"神鸦向千载，依然少陵句。\n不学柏台乌，台迁乌亦去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11862,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"至李坪驿始见竹筏上居民连亘三十馀家云随流上下作䕊治板行贩","author":"王世贞","text":"何必问故乡，浮家任侬住。\n一夜便风来，尽呼邻里去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11863,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"入黄州","author":"王世贞","text":"青衫曳地行，双眼鼻端看。\n此岂玩世人，怜为世人玩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11864,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青山矶","author":"王世贞","text":"武昌在前头，逡巡不肯去。\n为爱青山矶，且对青山住。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11865,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘太常亟言大城令忽君之贤也其善状非一至祷雨立澍矣予闻而贤之为赋四绝句 其一","author":"王世贞","text":"试按扶风部，应先数大城。\n神依灌坛令，民颂束先生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11866,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘太常亟言大城令忽君之贤也其善状非一至祷雨立澍矣予闻而贤之为赋四绝句 其二","author":"王世贞","text":"自是神君雨，那因少女风。\n河阳万垄绿，千树亦争红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11867,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘太常亟言大城令忽君之贤也其善状非一至祷雨立澍矣予闻而贤之为赋四绝句 其三","author":"王世贞","text":"霢霂沾衣乐，滂沱破块宽。\n好星元有雨，星是汉郎官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":11868,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]